            "scraped_replies": [
                {
                    "is_best": false,
                    "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Max clock speed is 550 MHz.</p><p><span class=\"lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline\" image-alt=\"TDK_0-1776259836377.png\" style=\"width: 400px;\"><img alt=\"TDK_0-1776259836377.png\" role=\"button\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/a55b4bcd-5e9c-1964-5e34-cc5c0e3ebcab.png\" title=\"TDK_0-1776259836377.png\"/></span></p><p>Achieved only in VOS0 and BOOST.</p><p><span class=\"lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline\" image-alt=\"TDK_1-1776259869516.png\" style=\"width: 400px;\"><img alt=\"TDK_1-1776259869516.png\" role=\"button\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/a05144d8-8a9a-b32e-83a5-9bd2f3977e33.png\" title=\"TDK_1-1776259869516.png\"/></span></p><p> </p></div>",
                    "author": "TDK",
                    "role": ""
                },
                {
                    "is_best": true,
                    "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Hello,</p>\n<p>I think you are talking about STM32H7 dual core that has that restriction in SMPS mode:</p>\n<p><span class=\"lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline\" image-alt=\"SMPS usage restriction from the DS.png\" style=\"width: 953px;\"><img alt=\"SMPS usage restriction from the DS.png\" role=\"button\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/27f24835-f121-bd18-9d4b-6f52e94c45df.png\" title=\"SMPS usage restriction from the DS.png\"/></span></p>\n<p>But STM32H723 doesn't have such restriction in SMPS mode:</p>\n<p><span class=\"lia-inline-image-display-wrapper lia-image-align-inline\" image-alt=\"mALLEm_0-1776260154680.png\" style=\"width: 400px;\"><img alt=\"mALLEm_0-1776260154680.png\" role=\"button\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/f22aef46-7816-71c2-e669-6cfb233e001e.png\" title=\"mALLEm_0-1776260154680.png\"/></span></p>\n<p>See also <span>FAQ: <a href=\"https://community.st.com/t5/stm32-mcus/faq-why-the-direct-smps-supply-option-is-not-shown-in/ta-p/853623\" target=\"_blank\">Why the DIRECT_SMPS_SUPPLY option is not shown in STM32CubeMX for STM32H7 MCUs</a></span></p>\n<p> </p></div>",
